# U-Boot environment location, for fw_printenv/fw_setenv.
#
# MUST match CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET / ENV_OFFSET_REDUND / ENV_SIZE in the u-boot
# recipe. Raw sectors in the gap between the MBR and p1 -- no filesystem, and
# both copies listed so the tools honour the same atomic redundant-write
# protocol U-Boot uses. Writing only one copy from userspace would break it.
#
# Device      Offset    Size      (erase block size omitted: not flash)
/dev/mmcblk0  0x80000   0x10000
/dev/mmcblk0  0x90000   0x10000
